@Fiskantes Seems like another western studio trying to capitalize on the famous game franchise which was made popular by people who don't work in company anymore. Many such cases.
Wanna play boyfriend? Sims exists.
Wanna renovate house? House Flipper exists.

@Fiskantes How are they optional if they directly affect the ending of the game? (relationship status with Lucia)
Also haven't seen somebody playing with option to ditch her/him and play solo.

Overall game is amazing tech demo with mediocre story and boring characters.
